      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"Stranger, you look like you've seen a fight or two. We've got a problem here, a big one. A wild Thune has been rampaging through our crops. It's not like the usual ones, it's monstrous!\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
